      ],
      "extract": "The quantity $Q(n,k_1,k_2)$ is closely related to $\\delta_K(n)$. According to \\cite{GV} for the 2-fusion knot $K=K(m_1,m_2)$, with $m_2 \\notin \\{-1, 0\\}$, we have the following possibilities: \\vskip 0.04in \\textbf{Case A.} $m_1, m_2 \\ge 1$. Then $$\\delta_K(n) = Q(n,k_1,-k_1),$$ \\noindent where $$c_1=\\frac{1 - m_1 + m_2 + m_2 n}{2 (-1 + m_1 + m_2)},$$ and $k_1$ is of the integers closest to $c_1$ satisfying $k_1 \\le",
      "extractCut": true
    },
